            <creation xml:id="creation_id875ac264">
               <date isodate="1888-08-03" xml:id="date_N203E0">1888-08-03</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_idf72b9173">
               <p xml:id="idm118">Adolf Langsted at the request of Hartmann in December 1887, sent him some information concerning those songs in his "Et Korstog. En religiøs-romantisk Digtning" (A Crusade. A Religious-Romantic Poem) which were suited for music. He particularly recommended "Morgensang" because of its special rhythm and variation from verse to anti-verse. It was Langsted's wish that the songs should be ready in March, but Hartmann did not compose them until the summer of 1888.</p>
            </history>
